WEBVTT

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.633
Microsoft Copilot Studio has moved beyond

00:00:02.633 --> 00:00:03.433
the chatbot frame.

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:05.467
It is a low-code studio for building agents,

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:07.700
workflows, and agent flows that connect to business data

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.233
and publish where people already work.

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:11.767
With generative orchestration, an agent can choose

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:14.167
the right topic, tool, knowledge source, or other agent,

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:16.433
then ask for missing inputs and compose the response.

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:19.967
Tools turn intent into action: connectors, agent flows,

00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:22.333
prompts, REST APIs, MCP, and computer use

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:24.800
for systems that still only expose a screen.

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:28.100
The enterprise story is control: data policies, audit,

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.633
Agent 365 visibility, Entra agent identities,

00:00:30.633 --> 00:00:33.100
cost governance, and repeatable evaluations

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.433
before and after launch.

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.133
The executive takeaway: scale adaptive automation,

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:39.067
but run it like a managed business platform.
